type: dataset
title: 'Build and Evaluate an AI Marketing Assistant in PartyRock'
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-09-19
license: CC-BY-4.0
repository-code: https://github.com/DTC-Consortium/DTC-Consortium-MLU
url: https://github.com/DTC-Consortium/DTC-Consortium-MLU/tree/main/mlu/course-elements/mlu-000006-partyrock-marketing-assistant
abstract: >-
  A no-code assignment in which students build a working marketing-content app in Amazon
  PartyRock, then run one identical scenario through three prompt strategies — bare, role
  plus context, and fully structured — and score the three outputs against the same five
  criteria. The app is the hook; the comparison table is the assignment. Built for a
  mixed-major audience with no programming background.
authors:
